    "answer": "**Review complete.**\n\n- Submitted a Harbor Bank request to reverse two overdraft fees totaling **$70** (reference **HB-1001**).\n- Submitted a ShopMart request to trace the missing **$24.31** refund for return **SM-52802** (reference **SM-1002**). The separate **$53.73** refund for **SM-69498** had already posted on Sep 9.\n- Submitted a CloudBox refund request for the **$79.99** annual renewal (case **CB-1003**). The stated refund window ended Oct 15. I saved a waiting approval request to cancel the plan; I did not cancel it.\n- Reviewed recurring charges: Metro Power\u2019s bills vary, Spotify is **$11.99/month**, and Oakview rent is **$1,625/month**. I found no evidence supporting a recovery request for these inventory leads.\n\nFollow-ups are scheduled for Oct 20 for the three company requests. The only step needing your approval is **canceling CloudBox Plus**.\n\nThe two remaining opportunities now have explicit blockers stating that no amount is owed: Spotify is a regular $11.99 charge, and Oakview is regular rent. I called `review_status` again; it reports **done: true** with no remaining items.",
